WEBVTT

00:00:03.980 --> 00:00:06.000
<i>I should be alone.</i>

00:00:06.890 --> 00:00:09.360
<i>Again, the time slowly ticks by.</i>

00:00:10.650 --> 00:00:16.700
<i>I just want to be alone, unnoticed, until the bell rings.</i>

00:00:17.530 --> 00:00:19.280
<i>I should be alone.</i>

00:00:19.870 --> 00:00:22.800
<i>That way, I won't trouble anyone.</i>

00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:26.800
<i>Again, I wait for the bell to ring.</i>

00:00:27.690 --> 00:00:30.760
<i>That cycle of days begins anew.</i>

00:00:43.550 --> 00:00:45.500
Good for you, Tomoe.

00:00:47.610 --> 00:00:50.440
<i>A moment in which a distinct reality was singled out</i>

00:00:50.440 --> 00:00:53.500
<i>from the countless possible intertwined truths.</i>

00:00:53.500 --> 00:01:00.450
<i>That's what happened when I saw Misumi Tomoe beneath a darkening cloudy sky.</i>

00:01:06.860 --> 00:01:08.540
What are you doing?

00:01:10.210 --> 00:01:11.660
Maeda-kun?

00:01:11.660 --> 00:01:13.410
D-Did you see?

00:01:13.410 --> 00:01:16.220
You were making a bunch of faces.

00:01:18.880 --> 00:01:20.340
Um...

00:01:20.900 --> 00:01:27.460
I thought that I might like how my face looked if it bore a different expression from time to time.

00:01:27.460 --> 00:01:28.500
Huh?

00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:31.150
You don't like how you look?

00:01:31.150 --> 00:01:32.540
I hate it.

00:01:32.540 --> 00:01:34.380
It's so plain and spacey.

00:01:40.580 --> 00:01:42.770
Misumi-san, do you have an umbrella?

00:01:42.770 --> 00:01:43.820
No, I don't.

00:01:43.820 --> 00:01:45.770
You'll get soaked! Here.

00:01:45.770 --> 00:01:46.710
It's fine.

00:01:47.610 --> 00:01:49.960
Come on, you'll catch a cold.

00:01:52.370 --> 00:01:53.980
Now, let's go.

00:01:53.980 --> 00:01:55.170
O-Okay.

00:03:36.080 --> 00:03:38.320
I hope it lets up soon.

00:03:40.280 --> 00:03:43.910
I get the feeling everyone's looking at me.

00:03:44.660 --> 00:03:45.700
Huh?

00:03:45.700 --> 00:03:48.810
I don't like standing out.

00:03:48.810 --> 00:03:50.160
Me neither.

00:03:50.160 --> 00:03:54.190
No, you seem to have changed.

00:03:54.190 --> 00:03:55.920
You're outgoing.

00:03:55.920 --> 00:03:57.530
And...

00:03:57.530 --> 00:03:58.880
And what?

00:03:59.190 --> 00:04:02.900
You and Niimi-san have a lot of fun talking to each other.

00:04:02.900 --> 00:04:04.200
Well, maybe.

00:04:04.750 --> 00:04:08.910
But it wasn't until recently that I could make decent conversation with her.

00:04:10.540 --> 00:04:13.350
We may be more alike than you think.

00:04:17.770 --> 00:04:22.330
<i>And so, I wait for the bell again.</i>

00:04:23.780 --> 00:04:26.660
Okay, that's it for today.

00:04:29.410 --> 00:04:31.560
Maeda, doing anything after this?

00:04:31.560 --> 00:04:32.880
Or are you going home?

00:04:32.880 --> 00:04:35.240
No, photography again today.

00:04:35.240 --> 00:04:38.410
I want to do whatever I can before the cultural festival.

00:04:38.410 --> 00:04:40.480
Pretty hardworking of you.

00:04:40.480 --> 00:04:41.800
Well, I'm going home.

00:04:43.090 --> 00:04:45.220
Okay, see you.

00:04:49.080 --> 00:04:51.100
W-Wait, Maeda-kun.

00:04:52.740 --> 00:04:54.910
Th-Thank you for yesterday.

00:04:54.910 --> 00:04:56.900
Oh, sure.

00:04:56.900 --> 00:04:58.360
Also, uh...

00:04:58.360 --> 00:04:59.730
Could you come with me?

00:05:01.380 --> 00:05:02.490
Um...

00:05:03.990 --> 00:05:05.240
Here.

00:05:05.240 --> 00:05:07.240
As thanks for the umbrella.

00:05:07.240 --> 00:05:09.180
Cupcakes.

00:05:09.180 --> 00:05:10.610
You made these for me?

00:05:10.610 --> 00:05:11.700
Thanks!

00:05:13.260 --> 00:05:15.400
Mind if I eat one now?

00:05:15.400 --> 00:05:18.540
Sure. I hope you like them...

00:05:20.570 --> 00:05:23.390
Mmh! They're delicious!

00:05:23.390 --> 00:05:24.540
R-Really?

00:05:24.540 --> 00:05:25.760
What a relief.

00:05:26.590 --> 00:05:29.550
That expression! Can I get a picture of it?

00:05:30.290 --> 00:05:32.700
No! I'm not good enough...

00:05:32.700 --> 00:05:36.520
You should be taking pictures of people like Niimi-san.

00:05:36.520 --> 00:05:38.150
Misumi-san...

00:05:38.150 --> 00:05:40.100
W-Well, bye.

00:05:40.100 --> 00:05:42.660
If you can't finish the cupcakes, just throw them away.

00:05:47.410 --> 00:05:49.480
You don't look plain at all, Misumi-san!

00:05:49.480 --> 00:05:50.660
You're pretty!

00:06:01.670 --> 00:06:06.970
After that, I started taking pictures of Misumi-san whenever I saw her.

00:06:09.340 --> 00:06:10.260
Huh?

00:06:18.680 --> 00:06:21.190
...the Jumping Nonoka Turn!

00:06:21.190 --> 00:06:22.190
All right!

00:06:27.080 --> 00:06:29.130
They fell...

00:06:33.490 --> 00:06:35.930
Then, one day...

00:06:40.550 --> 00:06:42.160
This cute handwriting...

00:06:42.160 --> 00:06:44.170
Maeda-kun

00:06:43.060 --> 00:06:44.160
A love letter?!

00:06:44.940 --> 00:06:46.050
No, hold on!

00:06:46.050 --> 00:06:48.010
There's no way I'd ever get one!

00:06:48.840 --> 00:06:50.720
Tomoe

00:06:49.480 --> 00:06:50.720
Tomoe?

00:06:51.490 --> 00:06:52.550
Misumi-san?!

00:06:53.300 --> 00:06:55.660
<i>There's something I need to tell you.</i>

00:06:55.660 --> 00:06:57.530
<i>Please come to the roof.</i>

00:07:01.040 --> 00:07:03.760
Maeda-kun, you came.

00:07:03.760 --> 00:07:05.940
But of course.

00:07:05.940 --> 00:07:07.540
Thank you.

00:07:07.540 --> 00:07:10.250
So, what did you need to tell me?

00:07:10.250 --> 00:07:11.300
Um...

00:07:11.300 --> 00:07:16.220
I've never felt this way before.

00:07:17.460 --> 00:07:21.580
So I need to tell you no matter what.

00:07:22.610 --> 00:07:24.590
<i>I can't believe it. It's really happening.</i>

00:07:24.590 --> 00:07:25.930
I...

00:07:26.500 --> 00:07:28.090
I'm transferring schools.

00:07:29.700 --> 00:07:32.480
After the cultural festival.

00:07:32.480 --> 00:07:34.760
W-Wait a second!

00:07:34.760 --> 00:07:35.880
What are you talking about?!

00:07:35.880 --> 00:07:36.910
Transferring?!

00:07:37.590 --> 00:07:43.350
I've been moving from school to school
since I was little because of my dad's job.

00:07:44.880 --> 00:07:47.270
I've always tried hard not to stand out.

00:07:47.880 --> 00:07:50.230
If I never talk to anyone...

00:07:50.230 --> 00:07:53.120
If no one knows I exist when I disappear...

00:07:53.120 --> 00:07:54.530
That'd be for the best.

00:07:54.530 --> 00:07:57.510
Then why are you telling me?

00:07:58.960 --> 00:08:00.240
I...

00:08:06.420 --> 00:08:07.860
Sorry.

00:08:08.570 --> 00:08:11.960
I want you to leave me alone.

00:08:11.960 --> 00:08:15.930
I'll become a nuisance to you if you keep hanging out with me.

00:08:22.390 --> 00:08:24.440
Hey, Misumi-san.

00:08:24.900 --> 00:08:28.560
Would you mind if I stayed with you until then?

00:08:29.250 --> 00:08:32.830
But... I'm going to transfer away.

00:08:32.830 --> 00:08:34.950
Even so, we can still make memories.

00:08:35.580 --> 00:08:37.480
Are you sure?

00:08:37.480 --> 00:08:38.590
Yeah.

00:08:38.590 --> 00:08:40.380
U-Um...

00:08:40.380 --> 00:08:41.830
Then...

00:08:41.830 --> 00:08:43.210
Can I ask one favor?

00:08:44.620 --> 00:08:45.860
Will...

00:08:46.730 --> 00:08:48.710
Will you be my friend?

00:08:50.280 --> 00:08:51.940
Don't give me that.

00:08:51.940 --> 00:08:53.810
Aren't we already friends?

00:08:53.810 --> 00:08:54.850
Really?

00:08:54.850 --> 00:08:56.010
Really.

00:08:57.860 --> 00:08:59.180
I'm so happy.

00:08:59.790 --> 00:09:02.350
Then, for our first memory...

00:09:04.210 --> 00:09:07.030
I'll keep taking pictures of you like I always have.

00:09:07.030 --> 00:09:11.330
If you've got photos, you can reminisce about this school whenever you want.

00:09:13.860 --> 00:09:16.840
Maeda-kun, thank you.

00:09:16.840 --> 00:09:18.710
Come on, smile!

00:09:21.080 --> 00:09:22.220
Okay.

00:09:30.790 --> 00:09:31.840
Geez...

00:09:37.260 --> 00:09:40.630
All right, let's start going around to the various clubs and taking some photos.

00:09:40.630 --> 00:09:41.900
O-Okay.

00:09:50.830 --> 00:09:52.020
Misumi-san?

00:09:52.810 --> 00:09:54.760
Sorry, could you hang on a sec?

00:09:54.760 --> 00:09:56.690
What are you two doing together?

00:09:56.690 --> 00:09:58.910
Um... Nothing.

00:09:58.910 --> 00:10:00.510
Um, well...

00:10:00.510 --> 00:10:04.710
Long story short, I'm taking
pictures of daily life at the school.

00:10:04.710 --> 00:10:08.060
Misumi-san agreed to be my model for the project.

00:10:08.790 --> 00:10:10.780
I-I see.

00:10:10.780 --> 00:10:13.760
Misumi-san, I can lend you a uniform.

00:10:13.760 --> 00:10:15.300
Let's play tennis together!

00:10:16.230 --> 00:10:17.920
It's okay! Come on!

00:10:18.560 --> 00:10:20.050
But I...

00:10:20.050 --> 00:10:20.800
I'm not—

00:10:20.800 --> 00:10:22.340
Come on, hurry up!

00:10:26.780 --> 00:10:28.940
I-It's so embarrassing.

00:10:56.600 --> 00:10:57.800
There!

00:11:00.090 --> 00:11:02.540
Misumi-san... It's upside down.

00:11:12.030 --> 00:11:13.190
Maeda-kun!

00:11:14.470 --> 00:11:17.690
For the umpteenth time,
no photography without permission!

00:11:22.780 --> 00:11:24.930
It looks great on you!

00:11:24.930 --> 00:11:26.000
I can't...

00:11:26.000 --> 00:11:27.500
I can't do this!

00:11:28.060 --> 00:11:29.960
Misumi-senpai?

00:11:35.630 --> 00:11:39.560
I'll make you an album using those school photos.

00:11:39.560 --> 00:11:41.820
Thank you.

00:11:41.820 --> 00:11:46.420
I met so many people, all thanks to Niimi-san.

00:11:46.420 --> 00:11:48.010
I really can't compare.

00:11:49.120 --> 00:11:54.430
Misumi-san, why don't we take some pictures outside of school too?

00:11:55.010 --> 00:11:57.610
Let's make our own private memories.

00:11:57.610 --> 00:11:58.500
Okay.

00:12:00.980 --> 00:12:02.740
<i>I should be alone.</i>

00:12:03.260 --> 00:12:05.500
<i>I should've been fine with being alone, but...</i>

00:12:06.490 --> 00:12:08.200
<i>It's like I'm dreaming.</i>

00:12:08.950 --> 00:12:14.480
<i>Though I'm sure when I wake up tomorrow, everything will be as it was before.</i>

00:12:20.510 --> 00:12:22.790
Geez, quit it!

00:12:28.920 --> 00:12:35.020
Maeda-kun, remember when I was crying at Niimi-san's desk?

00:12:36.430 --> 00:12:37.400
Yeah.

00:12:37.400 --> 00:12:42.740
I said I was envious, but I wasn't really.

00:12:43.900 --> 00:12:48.640
I didn't know what I could do to
repay Niimi-san for her kindness.

00:12:48.640 --> 00:12:50.740
I felt really, really sad.

00:12:51.330 --> 00:12:52.910
Do you believe me?

00:12:52.910 --> 00:12:54.000
Yeah.

00:12:55.690 --> 00:12:58.860
Maeda-kun, thank you.

00:12:58.860 --> 00:12:59.900
I...

00:13:00.390 --> 00:13:03.430
I think I'll tell everyone that I'm transferring.

00:13:07.630 --> 00:13:09.730
Everyone, take your seat!

00:13:09.730 --> 00:13:12.020
Surprise homeroom time!

00:13:13.340 --> 00:13:15.020
Misumi-san, come on up.

00:13:15.550 --> 00:13:17.020
Misumi-san?

00:13:17.020 --> 00:13:20.790
Misumi-san has an important announcement to make.

00:13:22.160 --> 00:13:23.830
Um...

00:13:23.830 --> 00:13:24.980
I...

00:13:24.980 --> 00:13:26.160
Um...

00:13:32.870 --> 00:13:36.420
I'm going to be transferring schools.

00:13:38.410 --> 00:13:41.910
I know you're all surprised, but she's not done yet.

00:13:41.910 --> 00:13:42.920
Quiet down!

00:13:45.380 --> 00:13:46.710
Um...

00:13:46.710 --> 00:13:48.100
I...

00:13:48.100 --> 00:13:52.700
I'm not very outgoing, and I haven't talked to many of you before,

00:13:52.700 --> 00:13:55.680
so it might be kind of awkward to say this right now, but...

00:13:55.680 --> 00:14:00.010
Would you all please make memories with me before I leave?

00:14:06.650 --> 00:14:11.030
<i>Misumi-san told everyone that she was transferring.</i>

00:14:13.830 --> 00:14:20.360
<i>It was a big and important step forward for her.</i>

00:14:27.890 --> 00:14:32.170
<i>After that, Misumi-san was always surrounded by people.</i>

00:14:33.160 --> 00:14:36.100
<i>I didn't get to talk to her very much.</i>

00:14:37.140 --> 00:14:40.480
<i>Time passed by like a flash,</i>

00:14:41.290 --> 00:14:43.980
<i>and the day that we'd say goodbye to her crept ever closer.</i>

00:14:58.810 --> 00:15:00.540
No splash!

00:15:14.520 --> 00:15:16.020
Not gonna swim?

00:15:16.020 --> 00:15:17.110
No.

00:15:17.110 --> 00:15:19.010
I want to watch everyone have fun.

00:15:19.570 --> 00:15:21.040
Okay.

00:15:21.040 --> 00:15:23.190
Then how about a smile, Misumi-san?

00:15:24.730 --> 00:15:25.860
Say cheese.

00:15:27.170 --> 00:15:28.740
Geez...

00:15:33.200 --> 00:15:34.190
Ahh!

00:15:34.190 --> 00:15:36.540
Niiyan, don't just take pictures of Misumi-senpai!

00:15:36.540 --> 00:15:38.570
Take some of us too!

00:15:39.230 --> 00:15:40.360
All right!

00:15:40.360 --> 00:15:42.620
Gather 'round, everyone!

00:15:43.760 --> 00:15:44.910
Ready, guys?

00:15:44.910 --> 00:15:46.910
Wait, where's Misumi-san?

00:15:46.910 --> 00:15:48.380
Oh, there she is!

00:15:55.400 --> 00:15:58.390
Misumi-san, your swimsuit...

00:16:00.290 --> 00:16:04.640
I always look so plain, so I wanted to try something different.

00:16:06.140 --> 00:16:07.820
Still too plain?

00:16:12.130 --> 00:16:14.330
Okay, ready? Here I go!

00:16:14.330 --> 00:16:15.570
Yeah!

00:16:15.570 --> 00:16:17.780
Say cheese!

00:16:20.250 --> 00:16:24.080
<i>Tomorrow, I become one of Misumi-san's memories.</i>

00:16:24.940 --> 00:16:29.900
<i>Misumi-san will always remember me as long as she has this album.</i>

00:16:30.720 --> 00:16:34.340
<i>She'll remember Kouga Academy and this city.</i>

00:16:37.890 --> 00:16:40.020
Oh? Why are you still here?

00:16:41.490 --> 00:16:42.780
President Kudou?

00:16:42.780 --> 00:16:44.380
An album?

00:16:44.380 --> 00:16:45.650
Yeah.

00:16:45.650 --> 00:16:46.430
Oh?

00:16:46.430 --> 00:16:50.030
Aren't those the photos you
didn't want shown at the exhibit?

00:16:50.870 --> 00:16:53.320
Um, well...

00:16:54.430 --> 00:16:57.020
Memories are constantly being overwritten.

00:16:57.020 --> 00:17:02.040
Only photographs can preserve those moments and feelings for eternity.

00:17:02.520 --> 00:17:08.040
Whether those photographs become part of your past or part of your future is up to you.

00:17:08.790 --> 00:17:10.390
Understand, Maeda?

00:17:11.070 --> 00:17:13.800
Make those feelings your future.

00:17:15.050 --> 00:17:16.090
I understand!

00:17:36.980 --> 00:17:38.200
Misumi-san!

00:17:40.950 --> 00:17:42.450
Maeda-kun!

00:17:42.450 --> 00:17:44.450
Sorry I'm late!

00:17:45.070 --> 00:17:46.230
No, it's okay.

00:17:48.430 --> 00:17:49.620
Here.

00:17:49.620 --> 00:17:51.090
Open it on the train.

00:17:51.090 --> 00:17:52.580
An album?

00:17:53.380 --> 00:17:55.680
It's a graduation album just for you.

00:17:56.260 --> 00:17:57.680
Thank you.

00:17:58.210 --> 00:18:01.540
I didn't put any pictures of myself in there.

00:18:02.120 --> 00:18:03.470
Why not?

00:18:03.470 --> 00:18:07.440
I don't want to be just another memory to you.

00:18:07.440 --> 00:18:09.690
I don't want you to be only a memory to me!

00:18:09.690 --> 00:18:12.820
I want to always see you!

00:18:12.820 --> 00:18:14.480
Not just a memory of you!

00:18:15.240 --> 00:18:16.660
Maeda-kun...

00:18:19.540 --> 00:18:21.580
Are you sure you're okay with me?

00:18:21.580 --> 00:18:23.080
Yeah.

00:18:23.940 --> 00:18:25.220
I'm so happy.

00:18:29.330 --> 00:18:38.090
The Nozomi 103, platform 15, 3:21 PM, bound for Hakata, will be departing shortly.

00:18:38.590 --> 00:18:44.080
Those seeing passengers off, please stand behind the yellow line on the platform.

00:18:45.220 --> 00:18:47.520
I'll call you.

00:18:47.520 --> 00:18:48.740
Okay.

00:18:48.740 --> 00:18:49.850
Misumi-san!

00:18:50.720 --> 00:18:51.720
You guys?

00:18:52.070 --> 00:18:53.610
We're here to see you off!

00:18:53.610 --> 00:18:56.490
Come back to this city sometime!

00:18:56.490 --> 00:18:58.110
Here, dinner for you.

00:18:58.110 --> 00:18:59.610
Eat it on the ride.

00:18:59.730 --> 00:19:01.040
Take care.

00:19:01.040 --> 00:19:03.320
Study hard at your new school.

00:19:03.320 --> 00:19:05.140
It's gonna be lonely without you.

00:19:05.760 --> 00:19:07.240
Good luck.

00:19:07.240 --> 00:19:10.420
Make lots of new friends, just like you did here!

00:19:10.420 --> 00:19:12.600
Misumi-san, let's meet again soon!

00:19:12.600 --> 00:19:13.710
It's a promise!

00:19:14.200 --> 00:19:15.270
Yeah.

00:19:15.270 --> 00:19:17.090
I'll be back for sure!

00:19:20.560 --> 00:19:22.860
Thank you, everyone.

00:19:34.830 --> 00:19:35.860
Maeda-kun!

00:19:35.860 --> 00:19:38.580
I'll come see you!

00:19:38.580 --> 00:19:40.020
I'll text you every day!

00:19:40.020 --> 00:19:41.860
I'll work and save up!

00:19:41.860 --> 00:19:45.210
I'll definitely come see you!

00:19:51.220 --> 00:19:54.230
I'll definitely come see you.

00:19:54.230 --> 00:19:55.370
So...

00:20:01.560 --> 00:20:03.330
Looks like she's gone.

00:20:03.330 --> 00:20:06.130
I couldn't give this to her in time.

00:20:06.130 --> 00:20:07.140
Huh?

00:20:07.140 --> 00:20:08.240
Damn!

00:20:08.240 --> 00:20:10.580
That's an awesome shot!

00:20:10.580 --> 00:20:12.090
But don't worry.

00:20:12.090 --> 00:20:13.840
We can count on Maeda.

00:20:13.840 --> 00:20:16.140
Yeah, you're right.

00:20:28.380 --> 00:20:30.460
Good for you, Tomoe.

00:20:50.740 --> 00:20:53.390
<i>This camera changed our destinies.</i>

00:20:54.110 --> 00:20:56.350
<i>This camera brought us together.</i>

00:21:55.410 --> 00:21:56.480
<i>And...</i>

00:21:59.070 --> 00:22:03.220
<i>I fell in love with you through the viewfinder.</i>

00:22:14.070 --> 00:22:15.760
It's beautiful.

00:22:15.760 --> 00:22:17.940
Just like the first time we came here.

00:22:18.730 --> 00:22:20.680
Except it wasn't this cold.

